1846 0 obj
  << /ActualText (TNFC offers a wide range of fabrication and characterization services to academic and industrial clients\056 Many researchers require infrequent access to TNFC capabilities in order to prototype or analyze a small number of devices\056 For these cases\054 user access and training may not be practical\056 TNFC technical staff offer experienced service to perform fabrication and characterization processes on behalf of the user for a predetermined fee\056 \015\n\nTNFC is also a proud member of the CMC FACT Network\054 which leverages experts and state\055of\055the\055art toolsets from micro\057nano fabrication laboratories at Canadian universities for custom fabrication and characterization services\056 \015)
     /K [ 35 ]
     /P 1847 0 R
     /Pg 1776 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

